{"text": " You wake up in 1810 in London on Burrow Road. You walk into one enormous hall, hundreds of children in long rows, and just one master. Did you know that this school's founder, Joseph Lancaster, claimed one master could run a school of more than 1,000 children? Older kids teach the younger ones. In small groups, you write your letters in sand with your finger because paper costs money. Misbehaved and you might be hoisted above the classroom in a cage. Really, Lancaster thought it beat the cane. So what is school to you? A machine for teaching the poor by the hundred as cheaply as possible. By the time Lancaster dies, more than 1,200 schools are said to have used his system. Then the law steps in. In 1880, school becomes compulsory in England from 5 to 10. In 1891, for most families, it becomes free. Now, every child has to go, but in the next century, school stops being something you are forced into. It turns into something people fight for.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.54, "text": " You wake up in 1810 in London on Burrow Road.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 2443, 3279, 294, 7042, 322, 7031, 1892, 11507, 13, 50568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324343501396899, "compression_ratio": 1.5296442687747036, "no_speech_prob": 0.01608668640255928, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.7880669236183167}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.28, "probability": 0.9835350513458252}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.46, "probability": 0.9996308088302612}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.58, "probability": 0.9913448095321655}, {"word": " 1810", "start": 0.58, "end": 1.34, "probability": 0.9894072413444519}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.96, "probability": 0.7567903399467468}, {"word": " London", "start": 1.96, "end": 2.26, "probability": 0.9950706958770752}, {"word": " on", "start": 2.26, "end": 2.88, "probability": 0.7614085078239441}, {"word": " Burrow", "